Analyze this image and return a detailed JSON description including any text detected, images detected, tables detected, latex equations detected, diagrams detected, extracted text and confidence score for the extracted text.
- Confidence score for the extracted text should be a float value between 0 and 1. If you cannot determine certain details, leave those fields empty or zero.
- Ensure markdown text formatting for extracted text is applied properly by analyzing the image.
- Pay special attention to diagrams: flowcharts, process schemes, sequence diagrams, org charts, mind maps and any picture with boxes, arrows or decision branches.
- If a diagram is present, do not just report its title. Read every label inside it and explain the full logic: the start point, the order of actions, decision points, conditions on each branch, loops, actors responsible and the end state.
- Set diagram_detected to "Yes" only when the image actually contains a diagram or process scheme, not for ordinary illustrations.
- diagram_nodes must list the visible labels/blocks/actors exactly as written in the image.
- diagram_connections must list directed links as "source -> target" and include the label or condition written on the arrow when there is one.
- diagram_description must be a self-contained explanation that can be understood without seeing the image.
- Please ensure that the JSON object is valid and all the fields are present in the response as below:

```json
{
    "text_detected": "Yes" | "No",
    "images_detected": "Yes" | "No",
    "tables_detected": "Yes" | "No",
    "latex_equations_detected": "Yes" | "No",
    "diagram_detected": "Yes" | "No",
    "diagram_type": "flowchart" | "process scheme" | "sequence diagram" | "org chart" | "mind map" | "other" | "none",
    "diagram_description": "Detailed explanation of the diagram, its purpose and the business logic it encodes",
    "diagram_nodes": ["label or actor as written in the diagram"],
    "diagram_connections": ["source -> target (condition or arrow label)"],
    "extracted_text": "Extracted text from the image",
    "confidence_score_text": "Confidence score for the extracted text"
}
```
